        <activityName xml:lang="en">Precast concrete, high performance concrete, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Precast concrete, high performance concrete, at plant
Dataset describes the production of high performance concrete elements from self compacting concrete including all elements with a structural robustness of at least C70. Excludes the transportation to the construction site.;
UUID: 0977ebed-b772-3e65-b4eb-d94cf9c869a1
Includes infrastructure, energy demand, material demand, treatment of wastes, transportation
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Formation with steel casing
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0977ebed-b772-3e65-b4eb-d94cf9c869a1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
